Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了啊 小真零
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,咦…咦
